WEBVTT

00:22:29.519 --> 00:22:32.885
those potential entrepreneurs, innovators

00:22:32.885 --> 00:22:36.185
a platform where
they can express their ideas,

00:22:36.185 --> 00:22:41.111
provide their thinking to their region,

00:22:41.111 --> 00:22:44.281
to their investors, 
to their private sector,

00:22:44.281 --> 00:22:45.911
to their institution,

00:22:45.911 --> 00:22:52.106
showing that even though 
they might not really be 100% able

00:22:52.106 --> 00:22:56.300
to put their ideas in English 
or French or other languages,

00:22:56.300 --> 00:22:58.786
we are providing them with the means,

00:22:58.786 --> 00:23:04.379
telling them that partnership 
is providing you with that platform.